WEBVTT

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:05.230
Flying in the sky

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:07.360
<i>takaku habatake</i>
Soar high up

00:00:07.690 --> 00:00:10.110
<i>oozora o dokomade mo</i>
Anywhere across the sky

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:11.940
Shining Finger

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:13.820
<i>kagayaku hikari ga</i>
The shining light

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:17.200
<i>chi no hate terashi kiseki o yobu spell</i>
A spell that spreads
miracles throughout the world

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:20.660
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:26.330
<i>furimukazu aruku no sa</i>
Walk forward and never turn back

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:32.590
<i>mugen no chikara ga aru</i>
I have an unlimited power

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:40.010
<i>nando demo tamesu no sa</i>
I must test myself many times

00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:48.350
<i>donna ni kurushikutemo yaritogeru</i>
Do it all no matter how painful

00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:51.650
<i>ai wa itsumo kono mune ni</i>
Love is always in my heart

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:55.150
<i>towa ni kieru koto wa nai</i>
It will never fade

00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:58.240
<i>kono te ga sakendeiru</i>
My hand cries out loud

00:00:58.240 --> 00:01:02.240
<i>ashita e to hashire</i>
To run toward tomorrow

00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:04.000
Bright you now

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:08.500
<i>kimi ga egaita mirai e no shinario wa</i>
The future that you envision

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:10.840
Shining Finger

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:12.500
<i>yume o tsukamou</i>
Take hold of our dreams

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:16.050
<i>subete wa omou mama ni I get a chance</i>
Everything will go
my way if I get a chance

00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:29.810
Domon! Domon!

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:31.230
You fool!

00:01:31.230 --> 00:01:34.070
You haven't even completed
your training yet!

00:01:34.070 --> 00:01:35.180
So why?!

00:01:35.750 --> 00:01:37.650
Master!

00:01:37.780 --> 00:01:39.410
Domon!

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:44.790
Today's the day I defeat you!

00:01:44.790 --> 00:01:47.000
- Shining...
- Darkness...

00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:50.250
...Finger!

00:01:53.960 --> 00:01:55.510
Now, everybody...

00:01:55.590 --> 00:01:56.950
As you can see...

00:01:56.950 --> 00:02:01.760
...the final battle between Domon
and Master is about to begin.

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:03.430
However...

00:02:03.430 --> 00:02:05.970
...after all these battles,
there are only two days left...

00:02:05.970 --> 00:02:08.230
...before the Final Battle
of this Gundam Fight.

00:02:08.980 --> 00:02:12.160
Will the Fighters be able to
escape the evil clutches of Master...

00:02:12.160 --> 00:02:16.190
...and get to Neo Hong Kong,
the site of the Finals, in time?

00:02:16.510 --> 00:02:17.570
And now!

00:02:18.030 --> 00:02:22.410
Gundam Fight!
Ready! Go!

00:02:22.410 --> 00:02:28.450
Breakthrough!
Warriors' Strong Ties

00:02:42.890 --> 00:02:43.850
Domon!

00:02:44.140 --> 00:02:45.220
Domon!

00:02:52.870 --> 00:02:54.350
What is that?!

00:02:54.360 --> 00:02:55.440
Reporting!

00:02:55.440 --> 00:02:59.150
Those enemy units have completely
surrounded the Guyana Highlands!

00:02:59.570 --> 00:03:01.070
What did you say?!

00:03:02.790 --> 00:03:04.700
Just what is going on?

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:10.620
M-my right hand...

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:16.380
You men are such fools.

00:03:16.380 --> 00:03:18.820
Because you waste time on Domon...

00:03:18.820 --> 00:03:20.670
...you're now in this predicament.

00:03:21.470 --> 00:03:22.470
So now...

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:25.010
...just relax and accept
the end of your life!

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:26.830
Master...!

00:03:27.180 --> 00:03:28.390
Get them!

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:31.270
Master!

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:32.350
Duck!

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:37.820
Listen!

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:39.230
Right now, we must escape!

00:03:47.370 --> 00:03:48.360
Well...

00:03:48.360 --> 00:03:50.660
...I applaud you for escaping me.

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:51.910
That's just fine.

00:03:51.910 --> 00:03:54.370
There's only one place where
they could run to anyway.

00:03:54.830 --> 00:03:55.830
Domon.

00:03:56.130 --> 00:03:57.630
You may have gotten away...

00:03:57.630 --> 00:04:00.950
...but you shall eventually
submit to me.

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:11.140
The enemy has completely
surrounded us!

00:04:11.470 --> 00:04:15.110
But you're all aware that the Finals
commence in only two days...

00:04:15.110 --> 00:04:19.480
...so we must force our way through
and head for Neo Hong Kong.

00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:22.070
That goes for every one of us here.

00:04:22.490 --> 00:04:23.440
So...

00:04:24.150 --> 00:04:27.490
...I checked the capabilities of the
Gundam Head that appeared before.

00:04:28.050 --> 00:04:28.660
Look.

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:34.710
We flew an unmanned plane
to test it.

00:04:38.130 --> 00:04:39.210
Wow!

00:04:39.210 --> 00:04:40.420
Great!

00:04:40.750 --> 00:04:43.010
In order to avoid that attack...

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:45.880
...we must ascend to the
lower stratosphere.

00:04:46.340 --> 00:04:49.350
But we only have one aircraft
which can only carry our Bolt Gundam.

00:04:49.510 --> 00:04:51.600
So, if we want to get out of
this mess...

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:54.060
...we're gonna have to
abandon our Gundams?

00:04:54.770 --> 00:04:56.480
That's right.

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:58.900
Then that option is problematic.

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:03.110
We have no choice but to force
our way out of here as a group.

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:05.030
And to do that...

00:05:05.030 --> 00:05:06.110
Wait a minute!

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:08.780
What're we going to do
about Domon, then?

00:05:10.830 --> 00:05:13.950
I'd say the Bolt Gundam could be
repaired in no time.

00:05:13.950 --> 00:05:18.500
But it won't be easy fixing
Domon's Shining Gundam.

00:05:18.830 --> 00:05:21.460
I mean, its insides were
pretty badly damaged.

00:05:21.790 --> 00:05:24.920
No, it's not like
it won't work at all.

00:05:25.210 --> 00:05:26.220
Besides...

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:29.050
...I'll get to Neo Hong Kong even
if I have to crawl to get there.

00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:30.140
Don't worry.

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:33.350
I'll do whatever it takes to
repair the Gundam in time.

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:35.480
Right?

00:05:35.480 --> 00:05:36.350
Domon?

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:38.810
Hey, Sis! You're on your feet!

00:05:39.060 --> 00:05:40.150
Yes.

00:05:40.150 --> 00:05:42.150
I'm feeling all right now.

00:05:42.150 --> 00:05:43.900
So, just give me half a day...

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:44.610
It won't work.

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:46.780
If we waited half a day...

00:05:46.780 --> 00:05:48.490
...there'd be an all-out attack...

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:50.280
...and we'd be wiped out.

00:05:50.740 --> 00:05:52.580
Just half a day, right?

00:05:53.240 --> 00:05:54.950
I'm sure if we all worked together...

00:05:54.950 --> 00:05:57.040
...our five Gundams could
hold them off.

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:01.860
Hey. Don't get me wrong here!

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:03.570
I'm not doing this for you!

00:06:03.570 --> 00:06:05.840
I want to help out the lady.

00:06:06.420 --> 00:06:08.680
I'd have to agree with Chibodee.

00:06:09.180 --> 00:06:12.390
We just have to get to Neo Hong
Kong the day after tomorrow, right?

00:06:12.970 --> 00:06:13.810
I'll help.

00:06:13.810 --> 00:06:14.850
I know you will.

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:18.390
This is our chance to return
the favor for Shinjuku.

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:20.420
I believe we're all agreed, then.

00:06:21.350 --> 00:06:22.440
You guys...

00:06:24.070 --> 00:06:24.980
Okay!

00:06:24.980 --> 00:06:27.070
Let's get started and
get our plan together!

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:28.070
Yeah!

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:38.290
I will now go over our plan.

00:06:38.910 --> 00:06:40.960
This is our present position.

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:44.380
Since the range of movement
by the Gundam Heads is limited...

00:06:44.790 --> 00:06:47.960
...attacks from the enemy will come
mainly from the Death Army.

00:06:48.880 --> 00:06:50.090
To counter this...

00:06:50.090 --> 00:06:53.440
...we will divide into three teams,
and wait for the enemy.

00:06:53.970 --> 00:06:56.020
First, our defense to the north.

00:06:56.020 --> 00:06:59.810
I want Gundam Spiegel and
Dragon Gundam to guard the area.

00:07:00.390 --> 00:07:02.350
Of course, our officers
will assist...

00:07:02.350 --> 00:07:04.190
...and you're authorized to
use our mines.

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:06.190
Next, southwest of us.

00:07:07.070 --> 00:07:10.320
I'll have our Bolt Gundam
guard this area.

00:07:10.610 --> 00:07:13.030
Finally,
our defense to the northeast.

00:07:13.360 --> 00:07:16.530
I want Gundam Rose and
Gundam Maxter to cover this area.

00:07:18.160 --> 00:07:19.870
This army is massive.

00:07:19.870 --> 00:07:21.960
You think these mines
will be enough?

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:23.460
Well...

00:07:23.460 --> 00:07:25.920
...it's better than having nothing.

00:07:26.500 --> 00:07:28.210
Southwest reporting,
mine deployment complete.

00:07:28.710 --> 00:07:30.130
We're all finished here, too.

00:07:30.130 --> 00:07:32.130
Northeast here. We're all set!

00:07:32.840 --> 00:07:33.800
Good.

00:07:33.800 --> 00:07:35.550
All units stand by at your posts...

00:07:35.550 --> 00:07:37.310
...until the enemy makes a move.

00:07:37.310 --> 00:07:39.270
All we need is an escape route.

00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:42.040
If you put me in charge
of that task...

00:07:42.040 --> 00:07:44.230
...I can create one using this.

00:07:44.690 --> 00:07:46.120
A signal flare?

00:07:46.560 --> 00:07:48.190
What do you plan to do with that?

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:49.610
Yeah.

00:07:49.610 --> 00:07:52.280
We already have
ways of communicating.

00:07:52.280 --> 00:07:54.450
Could be risky, since it would
attract the enemy's attention.

00:07:54.820 --> 00:07:56.520
Yeah, that's right.

00:07:56.990 --> 00:07:57.660
It'll work.

00:07:58.200 --> 00:08:01.910
When used at the right time,
it should be remarkably effective.

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:04.750
I'll count on you
for the defenses.

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:11.380
You know...

00:08:11.380 --> 00:08:14.180
...even though they're rivals, true
Fighters rally together when needed.

00:08:14.430 --> 00:08:16.050
They're all such great people.

00:08:16.760 --> 00:08:18.300
Though they're not always agreeable.

00:08:19.510 --> 00:08:22.980
What's the matter?
You haven't said anything.

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:24.100
Quiet.

00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:25.810
Keep your hands busy,
not your mouth.

00:08:26.190 --> 00:08:29.780
Well, I think I found who the
least agreeable of the group is.

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:37.530
You fool!
What're you doing?!

00:08:40.910 --> 00:08:41.740
You have a fever.

00:08:42.450 --> 00:08:44.160
I'll get a doctor.

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:48.080
Right now, repairing the
Gundam takes priority.

00:08:48.960 --> 00:08:50.210
B-but...

00:08:51.300 --> 00:08:53.050
I'm a doctor.

00:08:53.050 --> 00:08:55.930
If I think I can't continue,
I'll be the first to say it.

00:08:56.300 --> 00:08:57.550
Please.

00:08:58.640 --> 00:08:59.690
Let me continue.

00:09:00.470 --> 00:09:01.550
Rain...

00:09:16.150 --> 00:09:18.820
They seem to be running around
organizing something.

00:09:18.820 --> 00:09:21.780
But I'll show them that nothing
will help when they're...

00:09:21.780 --> 00:09:23.040
...facing the Undefeated of the East.

00:09:27.620 --> 00:09:30.000
Master Asia has finally ordered
the Death Army to advance.

00:09:30.790 --> 00:09:33.590
The question is whether
we can hold them off...

00:09:33.590 --> 00:09:35.260
...until the Shining Gundam
is repaired.

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:41.850
North area.
No enemy movement yet.

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:47.940
No problems in the
northeast area, either.

00:09:49.230 --> 00:09:50.730
Argo! Argo!

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:53.270
Any enemy movement
in the southwest area?

00:09:58.150 --> 00:09:59.200
No, nothing yet...!

00:10:02.830 --> 00:10:03.450
They're here!

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:05.080
From the southwest?

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:06.450
Hold on, I'll be right there!

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:07.710
Don't come!

00:10:08.330 --> 00:10:10.290
These are decoys!

00:10:10.290 --> 00:10:13.420
Yes. An old trick I used
in my pirate days.

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:16.880
The main forces will attack
from a different direction!

00:10:17.550 --> 00:10:18.470
Hey, man...

00:10:18.470 --> 00:10:20.390
...hope you know what
you're talking about.

00:10:30.520 --> 00:10:33.060
Here they come!
They're really coming!

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:35.320
As a former pirate...

00:10:35.320 --> 00:10:38.440
...he seems to have some
expertise on group battles.

00:10:38.440 --> 00:10:41.030
Hey! Let's not get all gushy here.

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:42.910
Well, shall we do it?

00:10:42.910 --> 00:10:43.880
Yeah!

00:10:57.010 --> 00:10:58.210
They've begun fighting.

00:10:58.210 --> 00:11:00.220
Good luck on holding back
the enemy.

00:11:03.050 --> 00:11:04.260
It's dangerous...

00:11:04.260 --> 00:11:06.510
...but it's the only way
out of this place.

00:11:16.400 --> 00:11:19.940
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:11:24.530 --> 00:11:25.820
It's already started.

00:11:26.240 --> 00:11:29.160
But it'll be difficult to hold them
back, even for Argo and them.

00:11:29.750 --> 00:11:31.750
Hey, Rain.
You have to hurry this up!

00:11:35.170 --> 00:11:36.000
Rain!

00:11:39.760 --> 00:11:41.430
R-Rain, wake up!

00:11:41.920 --> 00:11:42.680
Rain!

00:11:45.140 --> 00:11:46.180
Domon...

00:11:46.890 --> 00:11:47.890
You all right?

00:11:49.270 --> 00:11:50.810
I'm so sorry.

00:11:50.810 --> 00:11:53.140
At a time when
everyone's fighting...

00:11:53.140 --> 00:11:54.440
Don't push it.

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:55.770
I'll manage the rest somehow.

00:11:57.270 --> 00:11:59.940
I'm the only one who's capable
of repairing this properly.

00:12:00.320 --> 00:12:01.620
I've got to...

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:06.820
Let's fix it together.

00:12:06.950 --> 00:12:08.600
You give me the instructions.

00:12:09.120 --> 00:12:10.660
And I'll follow them
the best that I can.

00:12:12.660 --> 00:12:17.420
You remember the last time, when
we fought together against Master?

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:20.380
Well, this time it's my turn
to help you.

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:24.130
I understand.

00:12:24.680 --> 00:12:26.090
But I have a favor to ask.

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:29.470
After we're done with the repairs,
let me stay with you.

00:12:30.010 --> 00:12:31.560
I don't want to be
separated from you.

00:12:33.480 --> 00:12:34.390
Because...

00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:37.400
...this Gundam belongs
to both of us, right?

00:12:39.570 --> 00:12:40.690
All right.

00:12:40.690 --> 00:12:41.980
I give you my word.

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:44.480
Because this Gundam
belongs to both of us.

00:12:45.450 --> 00:12:48.410
At the moment, thanks to
each of the Gundams...

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:51.290
...our defensive line is holding
against the Death Army.

00:12:52.620 --> 00:12:53.450
But...

00:12:53.450 --> 00:12:55.960
...the enemy's force is too thin.

00:12:55.960 --> 00:12:57.130
Something's not right.

00:12:57.500 --> 00:12:58.330
<i>Ex cuse me!</i>

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:02.010
<i>Don't you think I should go</i>
<i>help out at another area?</i>

00:13:02.010 --> 00:13:04.920
If the enemy's not coming here,
there's no reason to...!

00:13:06.430 --> 00:13:07.050
What's happening?!

00:13:09.140 --> 00:13:10.810
They're crawling out now!

00:13:10.810 --> 00:13:13.890
I take back what I said.
There are tons of them!

00:13:17.900 --> 00:13:20.230
From the way they built
their defense line...

00:13:20.230 --> 00:13:23.320
...I see they've managed to put
together some sort of strategy.

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:25.070
In that case...

00:13:25.070 --> 00:13:27.740
...I'll send our main force in one fell
swoop to crush them all at once!

00:13:54.720 --> 00:13:56.390
Observation deck reporting.

00:13:56.390 --> 00:13:59.020
We're surrounded in all directions!
Air, land and sea!

00:13:59.310 --> 00:14:01.980
Y-you mean this is
the enemy's main force?!

00:14:07.150 --> 00:14:08.820
That evil Master!

00:14:09.740 --> 00:14:11.990
How's the Shining Gundam
coming along?

00:14:11.990 --> 00:14:14.240
They say it's still going to
take a bit more time.

00:14:14.910 --> 00:14:17.020
What could possibly be
taking those two so long?

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:18.790
Director, I was wondering...

00:14:19.210 --> 00:14:23.380
How about we just take the Bolt
Gundam and escape by ourselves?

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:24.130
You idiot!

00:14:24.710 --> 00:14:26.880
You want to save your own skin?

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:29.840
Do you want to disgrace our
great nation of Neo Russia?!

00:14:30.220 --> 00:14:31.340
S-sorry, ma'am!

00:14:31.890 --> 00:14:33.300
To all Gundams!

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:35.520
Keep the main force at bay!

00:14:35.520 --> 00:14:38.060
For the honor of each
of your nations...

00:14:38.060 --> 00:14:39.810
...you are obligated to
win this battle!

00:15:00.160 --> 00:15:03.330
I guess we made the right
decision by setting those mines.

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:12.640
I never thought I'd be
saving your hide, rich boy!

00:15:13.010 --> 00:15:15.760
I'd prefer if you
didn't call me that!

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:20.230
Thanks!

00:15:20.890 --> 00:15:23.940
But you know,
there's no end to these guys!

00:15:25.610 --> 00:15:27.400
Hey, you seem pretty relaxed.

00:15:27.900 --> 00:15:29.990
Something funny at a time like this?

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:30.820
Well...

00:15:30.820 --> 00:15:32.160
...it just occurred to me.

00:15:32.160 --> 00:15:34.450
What're we doing out here...

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:37.290
...when we should really be
heading to the Finals?

00:15:37.580 --> 00:15:39.660
Yeah, you've got a point.

00:15:39.660 --> 00:15:42.870
The reason's the same for
all of us. It's that Neo Japan guy.

00:15:44.380 --> 00:15:45.540
But, you know...

00:15:45.540 --> 00:15:48.550
...the one who's going to defeat
Bro in the Final Round...

00:15:48.550 --> 00:15:49.460
...is going to be me!

00:15:50.130 --> 00:15:51.130
No.

00:15:51.130 --> 00:15:54.630
Sorry to disappoint you, but I
will be the first one to defeat him.

00:15:55.220 --> 00:15:56.930
I swear on my honor as a knight.

00:15:57.310 --> 00:15:58.180
However...

00:15:58.180 --> 00:16:01.230
...we must defend this place!

00:16:02.060 --> 00:16:03.190
Right!

00:16:03.190 --> 00:16:06.650
So we can make it to
the Gundam Fight Final Battle...

00:16:06.650 --> 00:16:08.610
...in Neo Hong Kong!

00:16:13.860 --> 00:16:16.950
I think it's about time
I make a personal appearance.

00:17:08.080 --> 00:17:09.750
The Shining Gundam's repaired?!

00:17:10.250 --> 00:17:13.130
I'm ready to go to battle now!

00:17:13.130 --> 00:17:14.420
Wait, Domon!

00:17:14.420 --> 00:17:16.220
It won't make a difference
if you join in now!

00:17:17.050 --> 00:17:17.840
Why?

00:17:18.430 --> 00:17:19.600
Don't you get it, Domon?!

00:17:20.510 --> 00:17:22.680
There's no defense left.

00:17:22.680 --> 00:17:25.810
Rather than carelessly rushing in,
we must find our chance to escape!

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:27.600
Nastasha!

00:17:27.600 --> 00:17:30.270
I need you to tell the Gundams
to retreat to higher ground!

00:17:30.940 --> 00:17:32.780
What are you thinking?!

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:35.190
I haven't got time to explain!

00:17:35.190 --> 00:17:35.820
Please!

00:17:38.610 --> 00:17:40.990
What's with that guy in the mask?

00:17:40.990 --> 00:17:42.540
He was hiding 'til a minute ago!

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:45.000
We have no choice!

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:48.000
Yes, given our present circumstances!

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:52.550
Okay!

00:17:52.550 --> 00:17:53.800
Prepare to launch immediately!

00:18:08.140 --> 00:18:09.310
Rain...

00:18:09.310 --> 00:18:11.980
They're here!
Master's main troops!

00:18:17.610 --> 00:18:19.570
Master!

00:18:22.830 --> 00:18:25.290
So, you're finally ready to escape?

00:18:25.290 --> 00:18:28.340
But you're a little too late
for that to happen.

00:18:34.880 --> 00:18:36.300
A mine?

00:18:36.300 --> 00:18:38.130
You take me for a fool?!

00:18:42.640 --> 00:18:44.350
B-but that's a...

00:18:46.890 --> 00:18:47.980
Good!

00:18:57.110 --> 00:18:59.030
Here I go!

00:19:13.380 --> 00:19:14.380
Wh-what is it?

00:19:21.410 --> 00:19:22.300
N-no way!

00:19:29.680 --> 00:19:31.230
H-how did he...?!

00:19:38.900 --> 00:19:40.700
You will pay!

00:19:55.210 --> 00:19:57.630
We did it!
That feels so awesome!

00:19:57.960 --> 00:20:00.590
That guy from Neo Germany
sure came through for us.

00:20:01.220 --> 00:20:05.260
So, the plan is to escape from
the waterfall where it collapsed?

00:20:05.260 --> 00:20:06.850
Well, don't just stand there!

00:20:07.140 --> 00:20:09.640
Let's go!
While they're still in a panic!

00:20:11.100 --> 00:20:13.480
Don't worry about Rain Mikamura!

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:16.030
I'll ensure her safe passage
to Neo Hong Kong!

00:20:16.980 --> 00:20:17.820
Thanks.

00:20:25.110 --> 00:20:27.580
I'll see you at the Finals,
Domon Kasshu.

00:20:32.460 --> 00:20:33.830
I'm sorry, Rain.

00:20:34.460 --> 00:20:36.050
I couldn't keep my promise.

00:20:36.630 --> 00:20:37.880
Domon Kasshu.

00:20:38.290 --> 00:20:40.460
We must hurry out of here as well.

00:20:41.050 --> 00:20:43.590
Awaiting us is the Final Battle.

00:20:43.840 --> 00:20:46.680
And that's where we'll settle it
amongst ourselves!

00:20:47.140 --> 00:20:48.300
Okay, Bro?!

00:20:49.470 --> 00:20:51.640
We're off!
To Neo Hong Kong!

00:21:05.320 --> 00:21:06.970
I'll see you there.

00:21:07.740 --> 00:21:08.660
But...

00:21:08.660 --> 00:21:11.060
...I still have a few things
I need to do here.

00:21:12.290 --> 00:21:14.540
Okay!
You can come out now!

00:21:19.790 --> 00:21:22.510
Staying behind so your
friends can leave...

00:21:22.510 --> 00:21:24.260
...tells me you're an idiot.

00:21:24.760 --> 00:21:25.880
Shut up!

00:21:25.880 --> 00:21:28.720
I'll no longer call you my master.

00:21:28.720 --> 00:21:30.600
As of today, you are my enemy!

00:21:30.600 --> 00:21:33.020
Master Asia,
Undefeated of the East!

00:21:36.060 --> 00:21:39.480
How dare you be so ungrateful
for my kindness in raising you!

00:21:39.480 --> 00:21:41.400
Today I'll shut that mouth
of yours for good!

00:21:42.320 --> 00:21:43.440
Look here!

00:21:54.120 --> 00:21:55.710
You're a fool.

00:21:55.710 --> 00:21:58.120
You would have been wise
to escape!

00:22:02.340 --> 00:22:04.800
Th-the Devil Gundam!

00:22:05.720 --> 00:22:07.090
Kyoji!

00:22:28.570 --> 00:22:33.200
<i>Ikusen no tsukihi ga nagaretemo</i>
No matter how much time passes

00:22:33.580 --> 00:22:37.580
<i>tadori tsukenu basho o</i>
There's a place I can never reach

00:22:37.870 --> 00:22:42.040
<i>samayoi motomenagara</i>
As I wander, continuing my search

00:22:42.500 --> 00:22:45.590
<i>aruite yuku</i>
I keep going forward

00:22:45.880 --> 00:22:52.760
<i>koibito yo,</i>
watashi no hitomi no oku de
Deep within my stare, my love

00:22:53.260 --> 00:22:58.480
<i>kasuka ni yureteiru shinjitsu ga</i>
There is a truth that gently floats

00:22:58.690 --> 00:23:03.730
<i>dore hodo tsutawaru no desho</i>
How much of it will you catch?

00:23:03.900 --> 00:23:10.280
<i>Kizutsuita kokoro to karada azukete</i>
Give me your injured body and spirit

00:23:10.660 --> 00:23:14.410
<i>atataka na kono mune de</i>
I will hold you against my warm heart

00:23:14.580 --> 00:23:20.420
<i>umi yori mo fukaku nemutte</i>
So you can sleep deeper than the sea

00:23:34.140 --> 00:23:36.430
Everyone, it's the moment
you've been waiting for!

00:23:36.430 --> 00:23:39.730
The Devil Gundam has ripped
through the Earth to appear again.

00:23:39.730 --> 00:23:44.150
And Master Asia continues
to attack without mercy.

00:23:44.440 --> 00:23:45.820
As he counters the attack...

00:23:45.820 --> 00:23:47.650
...Domon finally completes
his training...

00:23:47.650 --> 00:23:50.530
...and sets into motion
the ultimate Super Mode!

00:23:51.320 --> 00:23:53.610
Next, on Mobile Fighter
G Gundam...

00:23:53.610 --> 00:23:57.620
Destined Battle!
Domon vs. Devil Gundam

00:23:54.820 --> 00:24:01.440
Destined Battle!
Domon vs. Devil Gundam

00:23:57.620 --> 00:24:00.010
Ready! Go!
